[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4230621949","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118448#issuecomment-4230621949","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118448","id":4230621949,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78Kir9","user":{"login":"mikest","id":742517,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/742517?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest","html_url":"https://github.com/mikest","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-12T02:59:13Z","updated_at":"2026-04-12T02:59:13Z","body":"I have discovered that if I add _two_ more points, for a total of 3, to the track then the _first_ point, and only the first point will get called:\n\n<img width=\"1220\" height=\"201\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e3c0ac6-41c9-4fdd-9876-f2b871299944\" />\n\nThis does seem to suggest some kind of indexing errors, at least with Function tracks.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4230621949/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4230650528","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118448#issuecomment-4230650528","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118448","id":4230650528,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78Kpqg","user":{"login":"mikest","id":742517,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/742517?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest","html_url":"https://github.com/mikest","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-12T03:23:10Z","updated_at":"2026-04-12T03:23:10Z","body":"Stepping through the code, it looks like the METHOD track is getting called with a playback range of [0.0 to 0.5] which is before the on_interact() call in the track (0.6667 seconds) so it is filtered out.\n\nThis is because the track length is being set to 0.5s:\n\n<img width=\"638\" height=\"43\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/97731bfd-f05e-479d-b678-f90c6199bdb5\" />\n\nSo perhaps this is a \"You code was relying on a broken behavior and that behavior has been fixed, so now your code is broken.\"\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4230650528/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4230653356","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118448#issuecomment-4230653356","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118448","id":4230653356,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78KqWs","user":{"login":"mikest","id":742517,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/742517?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest","html_url":"https://github.com/mikest","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-12T03:25:49Z","updated_at":"2026-04-12T03:25:49Z","body":"Yes, that's what is going on.\n\nI am going to close this as \"Behaves correctly.\"","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4230653356/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4233218993","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118448#issuecomment-4233218993","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/11844